Relative Xpath

    1. Attribute Based
            //tagname[@attribute='value']
            partial syntax - //tagname[contains(@attribute,'value')]

    2. Text Based
            //tagname[text()='text']
            partial syntax - //tagname[contains(text(),'text')]

    3. Collection Based
            (relative_xpath)[index]
            ---------> use only if the index has 1 or 2 (max 3)


Axis Xpath

    1. Immediate Relationship
           a. Parent Child Relationship
                    Syntax: Parent-xpath/child-tag-name

           b. Child Parent Relationship
                    Syntax: Child-xpath/parent::tag-name

           C. Grand Parent-Grant Child Relationship
                    Syntax: Parent-xpath//child-tag-name

           d. Grand Child-Grant Parent Relationship
                    Syntax: Child-xpath/ancestor::tag-name


    2. Distance Relationship
            a. Elder Sibling Relationship
                    Syntax: sibling-xpath/preceding-sibling::elder-tag-name

            b. Younger Sibling Relationship
                    Syntax: sibling-xpath/following-sibling::younger-tag-name

            c. Elder Cousin Relationship
                    Syntax: xpath/preceding::elder-cousin-tag-name

            d. Younger Cousin Relationship
                    Syntax: xpath/following::younger-cousin-tag-name
